games that focus on personal horror have a lot less lore than games that focus on epic world spanning horror.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Amethyst is my birthstone. She/they.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26996-amethyst","name":"Amethyst","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26996_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"873"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-02T10:27:16-07:00","id":1543014,"title":"","content":"While the Curseborne core book, the one we're KSing right now, is focused more on personal horror, there are suggestions of the deeper lore that will show up as we release books outside of the core book. Massive lore is something that we will continue to develop, but too much lore in the first book can be really intimidating for folks, so we're trying to keep a balance of history and backstory with &quot;what do you do tonight&quot; writing. So I would say CB lands between CofD and WoD in that regard, with more lore to come.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5-richt","name":"RichT","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5_2.jpeg","title":"Onyx Path Creative Director","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"505"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-02T17:07:47-07:00","id":1543038,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>RichT</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1542998-curseborne-kickstarter?p=1543014#post1543014\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">While the Curseborne core book, the one we're KSing right now, is focused more on personal horror, there are suggestions of the deeper lore that will show up as we release books outside of the core book. Massive lore is something that we will continue to develop, but too much lore in the first book can be really intimidating for folks, so we're trying to keep a balance of history and backstory with &quot;what do you do tonight&quot; writing. So I would say CB lands between CofD and WoD in that regard, with more lore to come.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks! That sounds great. I might just check out the Curseborne Kickstarter.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Amethyst is my birthstone. She/they.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26996-amethyst","name":"Amethyst","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26996_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"873"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-11T10:07:04-07:00","id":1543586,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>RichT</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1542998-curseborne-kickstarter?p=1543014#post1543014\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">While the Curseborne core book, the one we're KSing right now, is focused more on personal horror, there are suggestions of the deeper lore that will show up as we release books outside of the core book. Massive lore is something that we will continue to develop, but too much lore in the first book can be really intimidating for folks, so we're trying to keep a balance of history and backstory with &quot;what do you do tonight&quot; writing. So I would say CB lands between CofD and WoD in that regard, with more lore to come.</div> </div> </div> </div>Sounds great to me. V1 hinted at more lore, but most of it (obviously) came later.<br /> <br /> I backed this on the first day anyway. I need my WoD/CofD fix, and this seems the perfect antidote.<br /> <br /> Besides, people can always take the rules and just add WoD/CofD lore to taste. That's half the appeal, I think. I'm fully expecting fans to make the equivalent of a Masquiem conversion on these boards at some point, and I'm looking forward to it.<br /> \u200b","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer, publisher, performer<br /> Mostly he/his, sometimes she/her IRL <a href=\"https://adam-lowe.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://adam-lowe.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","name":"adambeyoncelowe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-11T16:59:57-07:00","id":1543601,"title":"","content":"A little late to the table, I think, but I'm just now hearing about this. Absolutely kicking in, very interested.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24351-garygeneric","name":"Garygeneric","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24351_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"108"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}